WEBVTT

00:00.850 --> 00:02.020
Hi! I'm Xyh Tamura.

00:02.040 --> 00:04.300
I'm a transdisciplinary artist, researcher,

00:04.350 --> 00:06.450
singer-songwriter, and creative technologist.

00:06.600 --> 00:08.200
[xyhnthesizer performance]

00:08.600 --> 00:11.220
I work through intermedia art,
experimental pop,

00:11.280 --> 00:14.650
electronic literature,
the sciences and STS,

00:14.950 --> 00:17.300
theory and philosophy,
and social research.

00:17.700 --> 00:19.900
This includes things like
tools and instruments,

00:19.950 --> 00:22.650
participatory mapping
and arts-based research,

00:23.050 --> 00:26.400
video art and animation,
game dev, and musical theater.

00:26.750 --> 00:28.920
For me, my tools, art practice,

00:28.940 --> 00:31.500
and research kind of
cross-pollinate each other.

00:31.820 --> 00:33.020
I have a BS in Physics,

00:33.040 --> 00:35.300
and I'm currently finishing my master's
in Creative Writing

00:35.320 --> 00:37.350
in the University of the Philippines.

00:37.650 --> 00:40.280
Well, I've been working as a composer
and audio engineer

00:40.300 --> 00:42.650
for over a decade
in the media industry

00:42.680 --> 00:46.400
where I've done film scores, stage,
ads, sessionist stuff,

00:46.420 --> 00:48.520
and I also dealt with
graphics and video,

00:48.560 --> 00:51.700
writing, fashion, acting, 3D modeling.
